      ],
      "text": "The tree singer raises their voice in a haunting melody, creating an aura in a 30-foot emanation. Plants in the aura seem to come to life, swaying and rustling in response to the music. The tree singer's allies in the aura gain a +2 status bonus to AC and saving throws as the foliage around them shields and defends them from harm.\n\nThe aura lasts until the end of the tree singer's next turn but can be Sustained. It can be Sustained even if the tree singer is polymorphed. The effect ends early if the tree singer stops singing.",
